  "goodToKnow": "Austrocknen means to dry out or dry up: Der See trocknet aus (with sein), and transitively Die Sonne hat den Boden ausgetrocknet (with haben). Dry summers since 2018 have left German soils and forests parched. Figuratively, den Sumpf austrocknen means to drain the swamp of corruption. Trocken means dry. Regular: trocknete aus."
